|cups]] (720 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) rolled [[Cookbook:Oats|oats]]\n* 2 cups (480 g) coarse [[Cookbook:Oats|oat bran]]\n* ¾ cup (180 g) unsweetened dried [[Cookbook:Coconut|coconut]]\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) [[Cookbook:Currant|currants]]\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) golden [[Cookbook:Raisin|raisins]]\n* ¼ cup (60 g) [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] dried [[Cookbook:Mango|mangoes]]\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) chopped dried [[Cookbook:Apple|apples]]\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) chopped dried [[Cookbook:Apricot|apricots]]\n* ½ cup (120 g) chopped [[Cookbook:Almond|almonds]]\n* ¼ cup (60 g) chopped raw [[Cookbook:Cashew|cashew]] nuts\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) [[Cookbook:Pumpkin Seed|pumpkin seeds]]\n* ⅓ cup (80 g) [[Cookbook:Sunflower Seeds|sunflower seeds]] (shelled)\n \n== Procedure ==\n\n# Combine all the ingredients in a large bowl, then transfer to an airtight container to store.\n# Serve with milk, yogurt, honey or berries. The dried müsli will keep for up to a month in airtight container.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using oat]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apricot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cashew]]\n[[Category:Recipes using raisin]]\n[[Category:Currant recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Müsli","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"3 cups (720 g) rolled oats","sourceText":"3 cups (720 g) rolled oats","amountText":"3 cups (720 g) rolled oats","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cups (480 g) coarse oat bran","sourceText":"2 cups (480 g) coarse oat bran","amountText":"2 cups (480 g) coarse oat bran","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¾ cup (180 g) unsweetened dried coconut","sourceText":"¾ cup (180 g) unsweetened dried coconut","amountText":"¾ cup (180 g) unsweetened dried coconut","amount":null,"u